> How do you get more than one pet?

Four ways, basically.

1. Domestic animals (I think that's what they are called) may be tamed
by throwing tripe rations to them. Usually they will eat the tripe and
then be tame. The domestic animals are cats and dogs (I.e. the
complete list is kitten, housecat, large cat(?), little dog, dog,
large dog)

2. Reading a scroll of taming will tame the animals on the squares
next to you. Really handy in a zoo!

3. While polymorphed into an animal that may lay eggs (eg dragons and
nagas),lay eggs and pick them up. When they hatch, and the resulting
baby says "daddy", then they're your pet.

4. Some instruments may do this if played. These instruments, however
are very rare, so usually don't bother about this one.
